    "description": {
      "value": "<p>以一个动作，你可以挥舞这张卡片并瞄准距你120尺内的一个可见魔法物品。如果该物品不是神器，它的魔法属性将被抑制1分钟。这一特性一经使用，直到次日黎明之前无法再次使用。</p><p>As an action, you can brandish this card and target one magic item you can see within 120 feet of yourself. If the item isn't an artifact, its magical properties are suppressed for 1 minute. Once this property is used, it can't be used again until the next dawn.</p>",
